prompts.user_prompt:
Generate a monitoring alert object for Kubernetes pod memory pressure. Schema required:
{
  "alert_definition": {
    "name": string,
    "target": {"namespace": string, "deployment": string},
    "thresholds": {"warning_percent": integer, "critical_percent": integer},
    "notifications": [{"channel": string, "priority": string}]
  },
  "enabled": boolean
}
Use values: name='pod-memory-saturation', namespace='billing-prod', deployment='payment-processor', warning=80, critical=95, channel='slack-ops', priority='P1', enabled=true. Output JSON only.

Provide the localized error message object for key 'ERR_SEAT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED' in English ('en'), German ('de'), and Japanese ('ja').
Schema required:
{
  "error_code": "ERR_SEAT_LIMIT_EXCEEDED",
  "translations": {
    "en": string,
    "de": string,
    "ja": string
  },
  "action_url": "/billing/upgrade"
}
Do not wrap in markdown fences. Output raw JSON object only.
